.vercel

# Stray npm install that once landed inside the App Router directory.
# NOTE: ignore these two files ONLY - never the whole `app/app/` directory.
# Tailwind v4's automatic source detection honours .gitignore, so ignoring
# `app/app/` silently stopped it generating every class used only in
# app/app/page.tsx (sr-only, gap-8, justify-start, z-[70] ...), which broke the
# landing layout and exposed a screen-reader-only line on the game screen.
app/app/package.json
app/app/package-lock.json
app/app/.next/
